  "cited_article_id": "manage-practice-subscription-billing",
  "reply": "To change the credit card, go to **Billing > Subscription Settings**, open the **Payment Methods** tab, and click **Add New Card** or **Edit** next to the current card. Enter the new card and billing address, then click **Save Changes**. To view last month’s invoice, go to **Billing > Invoice History** and click the invoice number to download the PDF. Only users with the Practice Manager role can access these settings."
}
